<title>FINLAND: EFORE'S MANAGING DIRECTOR RESIGNS.</title>
<headline>EFORE'S MANAGING DIRECTOR RESIGNS.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish electronics component maker Efore Oy said in a statement on Thursday its managing director Kari Lahtinen had resigned.  </p>
<p>Efore said its controller and board member Pirkko Fabritius would take over his tasks until the board has named a new managing director.</p>
<p>Nobody at the company was immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0245</p>
</text>
